{
  "job_B8.1.4.2_20251003_114807": {
    "chunk_text": "cw\u00e6\u00f0: \u00f0\u00e6t folc cym\u00f0 to me, & bit me \u00f0\u00e6t ic him deme & cy\u00f0e him & he cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ne dest \u00f0u na wel. \u00d0u eart mid dysegum geswince geswenced, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge \u00f0u ge \u00fein folc \u00f0e mid \u00f0e is; ne miht \u00f0u hit ana Ac gehyr min word & minne r\u00e6d, & Drihten by\u00f0 mid \u00f0e; beo \u00f0is folc on \u00f0am \u00f0ingon \u00f0e to Gode & \u00e6tywe him his \u00e6, & hu hine man wur\u00f0ian sceole, & \u00f0one weg \u00fee hi on faran sceolon, & \u00f0\u00e6t Geceos of eallum \u00f0ysum folce wise men & so\u00f0f\u00e6ste, & \u00f0a \u00f0e him God ondr\u00e6dan & gytsunge Gyf \u00f0u \u00f0\u00e6t dest, \u00f0u gefylst Godes h\u00e6se & his bebodu; & cyrre eall \u00f0is folc ham on sibbe. Moyses dyde ealle \u00f0a \u00f0ingc \u00f0e he l\u00e6rde, \u00f0a he \u00feis gehyrde. & geceas arode weras of eallum Israhela folce, & gesette hi \u00f0am folc to ealdron, \u00feusendmen, & & \u00f0a forlet he Iethro; & for ham to his lande. ON \u00f0am \u00f0riddan mon\u00f0e \u00fee Israhela folc ferde of Egypta lande, hi ferdon to Sinai westene. \u00dea hi foron of Raphidim, hi wicodon on \u00f0\u00e6re sylfan stowe, & Israhela folc slogon heora geteld feor Moyses astah to Gode, & Drihten hine clypode of \u00f0am munte, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Sege \u00f0as \u00f0ing Iacobes cynne, Gyf ge min word gehyra\u00f0 & mine treow\u00f0a geheald",
